comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-01T04:38:08.197Z",pi-agent,"Confirmed exponential ReDoS in ASSIGNMENT_COMMAND regex. The separator between repeated assignment groups is [ \\t]* (zero-or-more), allowing empty matches that create 2^n parse paths. Fix: require [ \\t]+ (one-or-more) between consecutive assignments, matching real shell semantics."
body: ""
